Package: ishtaria-client
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libgl1, libvulkan1, fonts-noto-core
Description: client of the Ishtaria virtual planet
 Explore a persistent, federated, Earth-sized virtual planet with a fully
 customisable avatar. Built with the Godot engine.

Package: ishtaria-client-web
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: nginx | httpd
Suggests: ishtaria-web
Description: browser (HTML5 / WebAssembly) build of the Ishtaria client
 The same client as in ishtaria-client, exported for the Godot web platform
 (Compatibility renderer, WebGL 2, no threads, so no special HTTP headers are
 needed). It is a set of static files under /usr/share/ishtaria-client-web/html
 that any web server can serve; the ishtaria-web portal publishes it as /play/.
 .
 The page takes the server from its address: /play/?server=https://world.example
 or a path on the same site such as /play/?server=/server (a reverse proxy
 forwards it to the game server, so that no CORS is needed). A page served over
 https can only reach servers over https.

